        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise cutting edge <i><strong>CrockChain</strong></i> technology to generate a fortune in <i><strong>FliptoCurrency!</strong></i>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/7f4a633129ffe3b8d3819c26a864eb96.poster.avif?t=1765634607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/7f4a633129ffe3b8d3819c26a864eb96.webm?t=1765634607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Coins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Byte Coin -</strong> The OG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as stable as FliptoCurrencies get, but less swings means less opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/6437924e681dfd1c0ab45c5ee6830a4b.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Coin -</strong> The New Hotness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can do anything Byte Coin can do, not quite as well but with much more pizzazz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/2ba5be972e593a263b9c90b9172304db.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterium</strong> <strong>-</strong> The Enigma. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind that deep, dark eye? He'll never tell...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/d4f90f2124efe8a1fbce7db20830b24c.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doggo Coin -</strong> The Meme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dogs are great! Pictures of dogs are great! Digital representation of pictures of dogs are definitely a sound investment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/ce4baeb33c56ab14e5ab72ddf9f906e9.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 13 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Disclaimer: no real blockchain technology was involved in the making of this game. Honestly, I don't really even understand how that stuff works</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise cutting edge <i><strong>CrockChain</strong></i> technology to generate a fortune in <i><strong>FliptoCurrency!</strong></i>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/7f4a633129ffe3b8d3819c26a864eb96.poster.avif?t=1765634607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/7f4a633129ffe3b8d3819c26a864eb96.webm?t=1765634607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Coins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Byte Coin -</strong> The OG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's as stable as FliptoCurrencies get, but less swings means less opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/6437924e681dfd1c0ab45c5ee6830a4b.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Coin -</strong> The New Hotness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can do anything Byte Coin can do, not quite as well but with much more pizzazz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/2ba5be972e593a263b9c90b9172304db.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterium</strong> <strong>-</strong> The Enigma. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind that deep, dark eye? He'll never tell...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/d4f90f2124efe8a1fbce7db20830b24c.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doggo Coin -</strong> The Meme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dogs are great! Pictures of dogs are great! Digital representation of pictures of dogs are definitely a sound investment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623480/extras/ce4baeb33c56ab14e5ab72ddf9f906e9.avif?t=1765634607\" width=144 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 13 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Disclaimer: no real blockchain technology was involved in the making of this game. Honestly, I don't really even understand how that stuff works</p>",
